<title>FRANCE: France to hold food aid tenders March 18 and 26.</title>
<headline>France to hold food aid tenders March 18 and 26.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>France is to hold a food aid tender on March 18 for the supply of 2,190 tonnes of soft wheat flour to Liberia and a further 1,460 tonnes of flour to Mauritania, France's grain office ONIC said on Monday.</p>
<p>The flour is for shipment between April 1 and April 30 and comes under the World Food programme, it said.</p>
<p>France will also hold a food aid tender on March 26 to supply 2,500 tonnes of soft wheat flour to Zaire, 730 tonnes of soft wheat flour to Sao Tome and 5,000 tonnes of maize to Haiti.</p>
<p>Shipment dates run from April 8 through April 30.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
